meta {
  name: Get Export Wash Dataset
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/export/wash
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Export Wash Dataset

  This request is used to export all wash data (dataset). To test it, you must execute the request in a web browser to download the file. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, exported file, and broadcast message with Telegram.

  ## Responses

  **200 — Export wash successfully.** File downloaded as `xlsx` format and ordered in descending order by `created_at`. No JSON body is returned — the response is the file itself.

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}